  ✓ Check source fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics and independently rerun all positive proof claims
  ✓ Audit adequacy, program pinning, and every local K rule
  ✓ Run a fresh false-mutation non-vacuity test
  → Account for assumptions and write REVIEW.md with verdict
